Gov-t_RRCPZ258w&oe=6B01E992"}, "display_name": "Fencing VR: En Garde Arena", "keywords": ["Combat", "swords", "duel", "battle", "clash"], "long_description": "Step onto the virtual piste! Experience the world's most elegant combat sport with unparalleled realism in Fencing game.\n\nPowered by a realistic fencing physics , every parry, lunge, and touch\u00e9 feels authentic. Master the blade in a true test of wits, reflexes, and strategy.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n\nMASTER 3 DISCIPLINES: Duel against advanced AI opponents in Foil, \u00c9p\u00e9e, and Sabre to perfect your technique in every style.\n\nGLOBAL MULTIPLAYER: Challenge players worldwide in tactical, head-to-head Foil duels, where strategy is everything.\n\nPLAY YOUR WAY: Full support for both immersive, athletic Roomscale VR and accessible, quick-play Stationary VR.\n\n\nHone your skills, find your rhythm, and prove your worth on the piste.", "short_description": "Step onto the virtual piste! Experience intense duels powered by realistic physics and true 1:1 motion tracking where every touch\u00e9 feels real.\n\nChallenge players worldwide in ranked multiplayer, master your technique in the Training Academy, and customize your gear to create a champion.\n\nYour honor is on the line. The Arena awaits. En Garde!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.abstron.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "support_website_url": "https://www.abstron.com/", "website_url": "https://www.abstron.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recomme